        "content": "## 🔍 Useful LogQL Queries\n\n```logql\n# All errors from rag-service\n{service=\"rag-service\"} | logfmt | level=\"error\"\n\n# Slow queries (>1000ms)\n{service=\"rag-service\"} | logfmt | latency_ms > 1000\n\n# Celery task failures with traceback\n{service=\"celery-worker\"} | logfmt | task_state=\"FAILURE\" |~ \"traceback|exception\"\n\n# Search by specific error type\n{service=~\"rag-service|celery-worker\"} | logfmt | error_type=\"ConnectionError\"\n\n# Count logs per minute by level\nsum by (level) (rate({service=~\"$service\"} | logfmt [$__interval]))\n\n# Extract and graph latency\n{service=\"rag-service\"} | logfmt | latency_ms != \"\" | unwrap latency_ms\n```\n\n💡 **Pro Tip**: Use `| json` instead of `| logfmt` if your logs are JSON-formatted!",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
